	<dc:title xml:lang="en">Some useful cost allocation strategies for the shortest route relaxation of the set covering problem</dc:title>
	<dc:title xml:lang="es">Some useful cost allocation strategies for the shortest route relaxation of the set covering problem</dc:title>
	<dc:creator xml:lang="es">Djannaty, Farhad</dc:creator>
	<dc:description xml:lang="en">Shortest route relaxation (SRR) of the Set Covering Problem (S C P ) is away of relaxing the problem to nd quick lower boundson the value of the objective function. A number of useful cost allocation strategies for the SRR are introduced which are applied to a number of test problems and computational results are presented.</dc:description>
	<dc:description xml:lang="es">Shortest route relaxation (SRR) of the Set Covering Problem (S C P ) is away of relaxing the problem to nd quick lower boundson the value of the objective function. A number of useful cost allocation strategies for the SRR are introduced which are applied to a number of test problems and computational results are presented.</dc:description>
