	<dc:source xml:lang="es">SADIO Electronic Journal of Informatics and Operations Research; Vol. 9 (2010): Special Issue dedicated to ASSE 2009 (Argentine Symposium on Software Engineering); 67-97</dc:source>
	<dc:source>1514-6774</dc:source>
